{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48785","headline":"凌晨 · 卢照隣","name":"凌晨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日掩鸿都夕，河低乱箭移。\n虫飞明月户，鹊绕落花枝。\n兰襟帐北壑，玉匣鼓文漪。\n闻有啼莺处，暗幄晓云披。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照隣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}